	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Si quando miseris literis <placeName>Catarinae</placeName> tuae inscriptas, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>libenter meis coniungam et, si quando dabitur opportunitas mittendi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>literas in <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniam</placeName>, ut inde in <placeName ref="l869">Transsylvaniam</placeName> trans<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ferantur, curabo, ut bene curentur, quantum ego quidem potero.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>De rebus <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName> quae habui, communicavi; alia non habeo, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>neque interea aut alia aut plura accepi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Mirum est omnia <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tanto contegi solentio; fortassis aliter res habent, quam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nonnullis probetur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Recte facis, qui ex d. praeposito aliq<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>uid semper expiscaris.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Poterit hic plura caeteris <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>habere ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si vero <placeName ref="l522">Veneti</placeName> occupassent <placeName>Pelopo<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nesum</placeName>, quam nunc vocant <placeName>Moream</placeName>, egregie factum esset; verum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>rem tantam vix ausim sperare, praesertim cum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>dicatur classis <placeName ref="l2510">Turcica</placeName> excubare ad <placeName>Euboeam</placeName>, quam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vocant <placeName>Nigropontum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Erumpent tandem, vereor, et confligent.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Consignationem rerum <placeName ref="l2472">Polonicarum</placeName> a te <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>remissam iterum accepi.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De <persName>Brunnero</persName> primum a te <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>audio vocatum esse in <placeName ref="l774">Durgaviam</placeName> per <persName ref="p17966">Gregorium ab Ulma</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Miseret me hominis non indocti atque utinam modesti!</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName>Marius</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Möhr.</note> dimissus est, quod visus sit parum commodus ad <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>docendam et ducendam iuventutem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Si functionem <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>aliquam apud vos fuerit consequtus, opto illi animum trac<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tabilem et tranquillum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Miraris, quid factum sit cum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ducissa <placeName ref="l572">Wirtembergensi</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dicam brevibus: Venit <placeName ref="l21">Badam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>lavandi gratia, duxit secum suum concionatorem m<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>. <persName>Baltazarum Bidembachium</persName>, qui in eius aula verbum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>dei annunciavit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">At <placeName ref="l1898">Badenses</placeName> missis legatis in<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>hibuere, ne pergat concionando contra publicam de<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>linquere pacem.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Obtemperavit et singulis sabatinis <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>diebus transiit <placeName ref="l269">Künigsfeldam</placeName>, ubi audivit verbum <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>dei.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Cum vero pararet discessum, <placeName ref="l1898">Badenses</placeName> ab ipsa <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>mulctam exegerunt 200 fl.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Quod cum questa esset per <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>literas apud amplissimum magistratum nostrum, per praetorem nostrum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>vel proconsulem <placeName ref="l21">Badensibus</placeName> significavit, ne principi <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>hac re facesserent negotium; se totum hoc negotium <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>in se suscepturos et responsuros in proximis Helvetiorum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>comitiis.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Sic dimissa recta ad nos venit, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>magistratui gratias egit.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Excepta est autem honorifice <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>e<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>t benigne et persoluti omnes, quos hic in urbe nostra fecerat sumptus.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Deducebatur equis suis circiter 50.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Benignissime hoc <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>accepit et postera discessit.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Also sind die <placeName ref="l2448">5 Ort</placeName> komlich <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>lüth gägen frömbden und heymschen.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Sed omnium rerum <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>finis et vicissitudo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">De comitiis <placeName ref="l471">Spirensibus</placeName> nihildum <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>hactenus comperti.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Varii sunt rumores, a quibus scribendis <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>libenter abstineo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale cum omnibus tuis.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>nostros ordine omnes et gratulare nomine meo d. <persName ref="p1770">Carolo</persName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Ocyssime 28. iulii 1570.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem wolgelerten, frommen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>und getruwen h. <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p8016">Thobia Eglin</persName>, pfar<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>reren zuͦ Sant Mar<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>tin ze <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>, minem <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>lieben herren und <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>bruͦder.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
